{"seq":1,"slug":"filing-cycle-report-aggregation","title":"申报周期、报表口径与多辖区税额归集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-determination-remittance/filing-remittance-risk-operations/filing-cycle-report-aggregation","wordCount":2965,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"申报周期-报表口径与多辖区税额归集\">申报周期、报表口径与多辖区税额归集</h1><p>一个卖到 27 个欧盟成员国 + 美国 45 个销售税州的跨境卖家，每月的税务运营其实是<strong>同一批原始税行事实被切进十几张不同周期的报表</strong>：IOSS 月度表、OSS 季度表、各州不同频率的销售税表、若干国别 VAT 表。收银台已经把税额算对了，但「算对」与「报对」之间隔着一整层<strong>归集</strong>——把逐笔订单税行按辖区、周期、口径重新分组、折算、闭合，生成可提交的申报底稿。本文只讲这一层：周期如何对齐、报表口径如何定义、多辖区金额如何归集并闭合。上游的逐行税基拆分见 <a href=\"../checkout-collection-invoice-record/line-level-tax-base-apportionment\">逐行税额计算、税基拆分与运费折扣分摊</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-事实-口径与投影\">核心概念：事实、口径与投影</h2><p>这一层只有三个概念，但彼此正交，必须分开建模。**税行事实（tax fact）**是不可变的原子记录，描述「某一时点、某一辖区、某一税率下，一笔多少税基产生了多少税」；它是唯一真相源，只追加不修改。**报表口径（reporting basis）**定义事实被读进报表时的分组维度和折算规则——按目的地还是供应地、用哪个汇率、含税基数还是净税基。**报表投影（projection）**是把事实按某一组口径折叠成申报行的动作，同一批事实用不同口径投影，就得到不同周期的不同报表。三者一旦混进同一张表，归集就无法既满足多周期又保持可复现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"申报期-税务期与账期-三种-周期-不能混用\">申报期、税务期与账期：三种「周期」不能混用</h2><p>工程上第一类错误是把这三个概念压成一个字段。它们的边界各不相同，且<strong>一个税务期对应多个申报期</strong>的情形是常态。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>税务期（tax period）<strong>是税额归属的期间，由</strong>税行事实的时点</strong>决定：欧盟按「货物送达/服务完成」的供应时点，美国销售税按「交易发生地与时点」。它决定一笔税落在哪一期的底稿里。</li>\n<li><strong>申报期（filing period）<strong>是要提交的那张表覆盖的期间。IOSS 是</strong>月</strong>，OSS Union/Non-Union 是<strong>季</strong>，美国各州按月/季/半年/年<strong>跑档</strong>。</li>\n<li>**账期（accounting period）**是财务结账的期间，通常按月，与税务期可以交叉。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关键在于：<strong>税行事实只有一个时点，但会被投影进多个周期的报表</strong>。IOSS 月度表与卖家的月度账期天然对齐；OSS 季度表则要把三个税务期合并成一张表，同时<strong>季度内每月的账期数据仍需独立可查</strong>。底稿层因此必须保留最细粒度的「事实」，报表只是对事实的一次<strong>有参投影</strong>，而不是把事实改写进周期。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>申报体系</th>\n<th>申报周期</th>\n<th>提交截止（通例）</th>\n<th>归集单位</th>\n<th>锚点来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>IOSS（进口一站式）</td>\n<td>月度</td>\n<td>次月月末</td>\n<td>消费成员国 × 月</td>\n<td>欧盟理事会实施条例 (EU) 2021/…（IOSS 自 2021-07-01 施行，进口货值 ≤€150 门槛）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OSS Union（联盟内 B2C）</td>\n<td>季度</td>\n<td>季度结束后次月月末</td>\n<td>消费成员国 × 季</td>\n<td>Council Directive 2006/112/EC 第 369 条及以下</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OSS Non-Union（非欧盟卖家服务）</td>\n<td>季度</td>\n<td>季度结束后次月月末</td>\n<td>消费成员国 × 季</td>\n<td>同上，第 358 条及以下</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国各州销售税</td>\n<td>按月/季/半年/年<strong>跑档</strong></td>\n<td>各州自定，多为次月 20 日前后</td>\n<td>州 × 地方 × 周期</td>\n<td>各州税局；门槛由<strong>累计年税额</strong>触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>国别 VAT（如英国、瑞士）</td>\n<td>季/月</td>\n<td>各国自定</td>\n<td>国别 × 期</td>\n<td>各国税法（如 UK VAT 季度申报）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「跑档」是美国归集最容易被低估的一环：一个州的申报频率<strong>不是固定的</strong>，而是由该州上一个统计窗口的累计税额决定。工程上必须把「申报频率」建模为<strong>每辖区每期重新计算的派生值</strong>，而不是注册时写死的常量——频率变了却没切换，会直接触发漏报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"报表口径-目的地-税率归集与含税基数\">报表口径：目的地、税率归集与含税基数</h2><p>同一笔税行写进不同报表时，<strong>口径</strong>决定它出现在哪一列。跨辖区归集必须先把三组口径定义清楚，否则底稿无法与监管模板对齐。</p>\n<p><strong>供应地口径 vs 目的地口径。</strong> EU VAT 对 B2C 适用<strong>目的地原则</strong>：税归消费成员国。IOSS 与 OSS 的报表天然按「消费成员国」分行。美国销售税同样按<strong>目的地</strong>（destination-based sourcing）为主，但仍有 origin-based 的州（如部分历史州）按发货地。归集的分组键因此不能是「发货仓库」，而必须是<strong>判定引擎输出的管辖辖区 ID</strong>——这与上游税率判定保持同一权威源，避免两套口径各算一遍。</p>\n<p><strong>税率归集 vs 税额归集。</strong> 报表要的是<strong>税额</strong>，不是税率。同一成员国对不同商品类别有标准税率与减免税率（如 2025 年起多国调整：斯洛伐克标准税率上调至 23%、罗马尼亚上调至 21%、芬兰 2024 年起 25.5%、爱沙尼亚 2024 年起 22%）。归集层绝不可「用平均税率乘总基数」，必须<strong>按税率维度分别求和再分别乘</strong>。设辖区 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 内税率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的税基之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{j,r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则该列税额是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>r</mi></munder><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{j,r} = \\mathrm{round}\\big(B_{j,r} \\cdot r\\big),\\qquad T_j = \\sum_{r} T_{j,r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">round</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>先分组求和、再乘税率，而不是逐笔乘完再平均——前者是监管模板的列结构，后者会引入不可追踪的舍入漂移。</p>\n<p><strong>含税口径与折扣回退。</strong> 报表基数通常用<strong>净税基</strong>（对价 + 附带费用 − 折让），而非商品标价。订单级折扣与运费的分摊结果（见上游文档）必须已经落到行级，归集层才能直接按行税基求和。若归集层重新解读原始订单，就会与开票金额不一致，导致「发票可加总性」与「申报底稿」两张皮。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多辖区税额归集的数据模型-税行事实到申报底稿\">多辖区税额归集的数据模型：税行事实到申报底稿</h2><p>归集的输入是一张<strong>不可变的税行事实表（tax fact）</strong>，输出是<strong>每辖区每期的申报行（return line）</strong>。事实表每行携带：交易时点、供应时点、消费辖区、税率、税基、税额、原币种、原币金额、平台代扣标记、凭据类型（发票/贷记单）。归集就是把事实按维度投影并求和。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>ReturnLine</mtext><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>F</mi></mrow></munder><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mtext>orig</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>cur</mtext><mo>→</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ReturnLine}_{j,p,c} = \\sum_{f \\in F} \\mathbb{1}\\big[f.jurisdiction = j \\wedge f.period = p\\big] \\cdot \\mathrm{round}\\Big(\\frac{f.tax_{\\text{orig}} \\cdot fx_{f.\\text{cur} \\to c}}{1}\\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ReturnLine</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">round</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">orig</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">.</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cur</span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 是辖区、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是税务期、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是申报币种、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">fx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>该税务期锁定的折算汇率</strong>。三个工程约束随之而来：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>分组键三元组</strong>必须齐全：辖区 × 税务期 × 税率档。少任何一维，报表就无法展开成监管模板。</li>\n<li><strong>汇率必须按期锁定</strong>，不能按当日实时汇率追算历史报表，否则同一期重跑会给不同数字。欧盟 OSS 允许用<strong>欧洲央行期末汇率</strong>，且汇率选择<strong>整期一致</strong>；这个「期初确定、期内固定」的约束应在底稿元数据里显式存储。</li>\n<li><strong>平台代扣标记</strong>决定一行是否进「卖家自缴」表：Wayfair 之后的美国市场促进者法（marketplace facilitator）与欧盟的视同供应（deemed supplier）规则下，平台已代收的部分<strong>不能重复申报</strong>，但必须在底稿里<strong>保留为可追溯事实</strong>，供稽查时对账平台与卖家的分割线。</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[不可变税行事实表&lt;br/&gt;tax fact] --&gt; B[按 供应时点 定税务期]&#10;  B --&gt; C[按 判定辖区 定归集辖区]&#10;  C --&gt; D{平台已代扣?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[进平台代扣对账池&lt;br/&gt;不重复申报]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[进卖家自缴归集池]&#10;  F --&gt; G[按 辖区 x 期 x 税率档 分组求和]&#10;  G --&gt; H[按 锁定汇率 折算申报币种]&#10;  H --&gt; I[逐列乘税率 round 得税额]&#10;  I --&gt; J[跨期调整: 贷记单挂原期]&#10;  J --&gt; K[生成申报底稿 return line]&#10;  E --&gt; L[与平台结算对账]&#10;  L --&gt; K&#10;  K --&gt; M{底稿合计 = 财务总账?}&#10;  M --&gt;|否| N[差异入 reconciliation 队列]&#10;  M --&gt;|是| O[锁定底稿版本 + 审计留痕]\">graph TD\n  A[不可变税行事实表&lt;br/&gt;tax fact] --&gt; B[按 供应时点 定税务期]\n  B --&gt; C[按 判定辖区 定归集辖区]\n  C --&gt; D{平台已代扣?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[进平台代扣对账池&lt;br/&gt;不重复申报]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[进卖家自缴归集池]\n  F --&gt; G[按 辖区 x 期 x 税率档 分组求和]\n  G --&gt; H[按 锁定汇率 折算申报币种]\n  H --&gt; I[逐列乘税率 round 得税额]\n  I --&gt; J[跨期调整: 贷记单挂原期]\n  J --&gt; K[生成申报底稿 return line]\n  E --&gt; L[与平台结算对账]\n  L --&gt; K\n  K --&gt; M{底稿合计 = 财务总账?}\n  M --&gt;|否| N[差异入 reconciliation 队列]\n  M --&gt;|是| O[锁定底稿版本 + 审计留痕]</pre><h2 id=\"跨期调整-贷记单与追溯修正-归集最硬的部分\">跨期调整、贷记单与追溯修正：归集最硬的部分</h2><p>真实运营里，<strong>退货与贷记单（credit note）总是晚于原始销售</strong>。一笔 1 月销售、3 月退货，税额该挂 1 月还是 3 月？两种口径都存在，且不同辖区取舍不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>原期修正（origin-period correction）</strong>：把贷记单的负税额挂回原税务期，重算该期底稿。优点是每期数字与当时真实交易一致；代价是<strong>已提交的期要重新提交</strong>，触发更正流程。</li>\n<li><strong>当期冲减（current-period adjustment）</strong>：退货在当期以负行冲减当期销项。优点是当期即可回收；代价是各期数字与「该期真实交易」不再一一对应。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>工程上必须把「调整口径」做成<strong>每辖区可配置策略</strong>，并在底稿里为每一行标注它是原期还是当期调整，附原始凭证 ID。Europe 的 OSS 更正、美国各州的 amended return、以及英国 VAT 的 error correction 阈限各自有规则，<strong>归集层不负责判断用什么口径，只负责让口径可表达、可追溯</strong>。</p>\n<p>另一个陷阱是<strong>舍入闭合</strong>：多辖区多税率档各自 round 之后，底稿分列之和可能与财务总账差若干分。若采用先算总额再摊回列的旧惯例，会与逐列取整冲突。稳健做法是<strong>以申报行逐列取整结果为准</strong>，把尾差记录为独立的一行调整项，永不静默丢弃——稽查时「对不上但说不清」比「多了一分」严重得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对账闭环与报表版本的不可变性\">对账闭环与报表版本的不可变性</h2><p>归集的终点不是「生成一张表」，而是<strong>一张能通过稽核的表</strong>。闭环至少要三条对账线同时闭合：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对账线</th>\n<th>左侧</th>\n<th>右侧</th>\n<th>断裂信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交易线</td>\n<td>订单/发票税行总额</td>\n<td>归集底稿分列之和</td>\n<td>存在未归集事实（缺分组键）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>财务线</td>\n<td>财务总账应交税费</td>\n<td>底稿应付合计</td>\n<td>汇率口径或时点口径不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台线</td>\n<td>平台代扣结算单</td>\n<td>代扣对账池</td>\n<td>平台已代收仍被卖家重复申报</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三条线任一条不闭合，底稿不得进入「可提交」状态。底稿一旦提交，必须<strong>版本冻结</strong>：后续任何重算生成<strong>新版本</strong>并保留旧版本与它的输入快照，而不是原地覆盖。这既是更正申报的前提，也是稽查时证明「当时看到的数字就是这样算出来的」的唯一手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见工程缺陷\">常见工程缺陷</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>把申报频率写死</strong>：美国各州频率按累计税额跑档，写死的常量会在跨档时漏报。</li>\n<li><strong>用当日汇率重算历史报表</strong>：同一次重跑给出两个数字，审计无法复现。</li>\n<li><strong>用平均税率乘总基数</strong>：多税率辖区下与逐列口径必然不符。</li>\n<li><strong>平台代扣与卖家自缴不分池</strong>：视同供应规则下重复申报，或反向漏报。</li>\n<li><strong>贷记单静默挂错期</strong>：不能用「方便」代替辖区规则，必须可配置且留痕。</li>\n<li><strong>底稿原地覆盖</strong>：更正申报与稽查举证同时失效。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>多辖区税额归集的本质，是把<strong>不可变的税行事实</strong>通过<strong>可配置的口径</strong>投影成<strong>按周期的申报底稿</strong>。三条设计律由此推出：税务期/申报期/账期三种周期必须分开建模，一个事实可被投影进多张表；分组键必须齐到「辖区 × 期 × 税率档」，且汇率按期锁定；报表版本不可原地覆盖，更正走新版本加输入快照。叠加交易线、财务线、平台线三条对账线全部闭合，底稿才可提交。</p>\n<p>把「事实不可变、报表是带参投影、口径可配置、版本可复现」四条钉死，多辖区多周期的税额归集才从一堆手工对表变成一个可验证的系统。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"申报周期、报表口径与多辖区税额归集","id":"申报周期-报表口径与多辖区税额归集"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：事实、口径与投影","id":"核心概念-事实-口径与投影"},{"level":2,"text":"申报期、税务期与账期：三种「周期」不能混用","id":"申报期-税务期与账期-三种-周期-不能混用"},{"level":2,"text":"报表口径：目的地、税率归集与含税基数","id":"报表口径-目的地-税率归集与含税基数"},{"level":2,"text":"多辖区税额归集的数据模型：税行事实到申报底稿","id":"多辖区税额归集的数据模型-税行事实到申报底稿"},{"level":2,"text":"跨期调整、贷记单与追溯修正：归集最硬的部分","id":"跨期调整-贷记单与追溯修正-归集最硬的部分"},{"level":2,"text":"对账闭环与报表版本的不可变性","id":"对账闭环与报表版本的不可变性"},{"level":2,"text":"常见工程缺陷","id":"常见工程缺陷"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"合规发票、凭证留存与免税/退税单处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-determination-remittance/checkout-collection-invoice-record/invoice-voucher-exemption-handling"},"next":{"title":"平台代扣代缴对账、退款退货与税额冲销","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-indirect-tax-determination-remittance/filing-remittance-risk-operations/withholding-reconciliation-refund-reversal"}}